          "caption": "[Permen PAN-RB 53/2014 Lampiran II. A-F dan Anak Lampiran II/1; cetak 15-18, PDF 19-22](https://peraturan.bpk.go.id/Download/123556/PERMENPAN%20NOMOR%2053%20TAHUN%202014.pdf#page=19)",
